== Description ==

'''Titanium Ingot''' is a refined metal ingot in ''[[Human Host]]'', crafted at the [[Furnace]]. It appears as an ingredient in 23 downstream recipes at 4 different workbenches, including [[Titanium Alloy]], [[Titanium Buckshot]], [[Sensor Spike]], [[Titanium Bullet Tip]], [[Spiked Club]], [[Combat Knife]], among others. See the ''Used in'' table for the full consumer list.

